<tr><td>210 lb, 2 hours moderate</td><td>about 300 kcal</td><td>about 1,500 kcal</td><td>about 1.9 lb</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>*Using the rough rule that about 3,500 calories equals one pound of body fat, and assuming you do not eat more to compensate.</p>
